{
  "annotations": {"list": [{"builtIn": 1, "datasource": {"type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --"}, "enable": true, "hide": true, "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)", "name": "Annotations & Alerts", "type": "dashboard"}]},
  "description": "Uso de CPU del equipo que ejecuta el stack. Las series grabadas precalculan el porcentaje y la carga normalizada, que son las dos cifras que se miran primero cuando algo va lento.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [{"asDropdown": true, "icon": "external link", "includeVars": false, "keepTime": true, "tags": ["noc"], "targetBlank": false, "title": "Ir a...", "type": "dashboards", "url": ""}],
  "panels": [
    { "id": 1,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "CPU en uso",
      "description": "Porcentaje sobre TODOS los núcleos. Viene de la serie grabada noc_host_cpu_uso_porcentaje, que ya lo calcula así. El umbral de alerta es 85% sostenido durante 15 minutos; aquí el rojo empieza en 85 para que el panel avise antes de que dispare.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percent", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "max": 100, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "yellow", "value": 75}, {"color": "red", "value": 85}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"minVizHeight": 75, "minVizWidth": 75, "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "showThresholdLabels": false, "showThresholdMarkers": true},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "noc_host_cpu_uso_porcentaje", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    },
    { "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Carga normalizada por núcleo",
      "description": "Carga de 1 minuto dividida por el número de núcleos, de la serie grabada noc_host_carga_normalizada. load1 por encima de 1 no es un problema en sí: en una máquina de 32 núcleos, una carga de 8 es reposo. Dividir por el número de núcleos es lo que hace la métrica comparable entre máquinas distintas.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 2, "min": 0, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "linear", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "pointSize": 5, "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "none"}}, "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "yellow", "value": 1}, {"color": "red", "value": 2}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "noc_host_carga_normalizada{job=\"node\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    },
    { "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Uso de CPU por núcleo",
      "description": "Una línea por núcleo. Si todas van igual, la carga está repartida y el problema es el volumen total. Si solo una se dispara, hay un proceso o una IRQ con mala afinidad: ese diagnóstico separa «el servidor va lento» de «algo concreto está roto».",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percent", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "max": 100, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "linear", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false, "pointSize": 5, "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "none"}, "axisSoftMin": 0}, "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "100 - (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node\", mode=\"idle\"}[2m]) * 100)", "legendFormat": "core {{cpu}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    },
    { "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU por modo",
      "description": "user, system, iowait, steal e idle apilados. Un iowait alto apunta al disco; steal, a un hipervisor que le quita recursos al equipo; system alto, a mucho trabajo dentro del kernel. Sin este desglose, «CPU al 90%» no dice nada accionable.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percent", "decimals": 2, "min": 0, "max": 100, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "linear", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 40, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "pointSize": 5, "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "normal"}}, "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["mean"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "avg by (mode) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node\", mode!=\"idle\"}[2m])) * 100", "legendFormat": "{{mode}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    }
  ],
  "preload": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["noc", "equipo", "cpu"],
